cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Using NetRadar in your research? Please cite our papers, and mention in your
  paper that your testbed was built with NetRadar.
title: "NetRadar-FusionCenter: fusion center for the NetRadar networked mmWave radar testbed"
abstract: >-
  Fusion center of NetRadar, a networked mmWave radar testbed: MQTT broker,
  time-sync ticks for hardware-triggered nodes, on-demand multi-node
  self-calibration, a live dashboard and a PostgreSQL store, run with Docker
  Compose. Developed as part of the Chirp Capstone Project 2025-2026,
  University of California, Santa Barbara.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
